    "historicalContext": "Venerated in Belgium for her radical devotion to Christ. That detail is why St. Christina the Astonishing still appears in parish bulletins and school religion lessons around July 24. Fixing St. Christina the Astonishing on July 24 synchronizes memory worldwide: the same date for missals, schools, and family prayer. In a noisy news cycle, a fixed feast for St. Christina the Astonishing is a small act of Christian timekeeping.",
